                    {
                        "translation_id": "79e8ad81-5aa8-41eb-87a9-d50f635aec61",
                        "source_entry_id": "36a55e76-3de1-340b-9e34-2519209c668f",
                        "source_sense_id": "3fe75159-c957-36f2-b94c-cf9df9477620",
                        "source_sense_description": "Gemüsesaft, der auf Basis von Tomaten(mark) hergestellt wird",
                        "target_lang_word": "tomato juice",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tomato juice",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8bb5acdc-5f9b-384c-b2af-a7ff51a07692",
                                        "entry_id": "eb6b1d48-24dd-369e-b32e-aa797bb0146b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see tomato, juice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fce3aedd-6f35-387d-aadb-156dc8dca6a2",
                                        "entry_id": "eb6b1d48-24dd-369e-b32e-aa797bb0146b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Juice made from tomatoes. In modern use, this usually refers to the comminuted flesh and juice of cooked tomatoes, prepared commercially."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc383440-f2af-431f-a685-57d91ec877b3",
                                                "sense_id": "fce3aedd-6f35-387d-aadb-156dc8dca6a2",
                                                "text": "There were the delicate keftas, […] and lastly, the national pillauf, richly coloured with tomato juice, and flavoured with quails."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24b1647d-54dd-4bd9-8d1e-2c6864724bc3",
                                                "sense_id": "fce3aedd-6f35-387d-aadb-156dc8dca6a2",
                                                "text": "TOMATO SWEETBREADS.—Cut up a quarter of a peck (or more) of fine ripe tomatoes; set them over the fire, and let them stew with nothing but their own juice till they go entirely to pieces. Then press them through a sieve, to clear the liquid from the seeds and skins. [. . .] Put [sweetbreads] into a stew-pan with the tomato-juice, seasoned with a little salt and cayenne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92a603d1-8fc9-4a0f-b3fb-e740b70ed765",
                                                "sense_id": "fce3aedd-6f35-387d-aadb-156dc8dca6a2",
                                                "text": "\"See those two bottles of tomato juice?\" He points to two quart bottles on the counter. \"See how in one the tomato juice is settling out?\" ... \"Personally, I feel that tomato juice in a can doesn't taste good.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "717f5d5f-6ef6-4b9a-a9ab-342f5ab54f93",
                                                "sense_id": "fce3aedd-6f35-387d-aadb-156dc8dca6a2",
                                                "text": "[heading] Canned Tomato Juice [¶] While you have out all the equipment, why not make some homemade tomato juice as well?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "912b2b4c-2ad0-400d-8983-9e0a715eb48b",
                                                "sense_id": "fce3aedd-6f35-387d-aadb-156dc8dca6a2",
                                                "text": "The juice is always purchased canned. Freshly squeezed tomato juice exists only in the imagination of menu writers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eed47a86-6b7a-4396-93f5-457af8b46312",
                                                "sense_id": "fce3aedd-6f35-387d-aadb-156dc8dca6a2",
                                                "text": "About how long has it been since you last bought tomato juice? ... About how often do you buy tomato juice? About how many cans do you buy at a time? ..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
